    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "text": "Course Expectations"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "text": "For each credit hour, students are expected to spend a minimum of two hours on work outside of class each week.  For this three credit course that means a minimum of six hours each week."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "text": "Students must review the Academic Calendar published by the Registrar\u2019s Office online at: http://tinyurl.com/hbmfywj."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "text": "Class attendance is expected of all students up to and including the last day of scheduled Finals in the semester.  Students must plan accordingly."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "alignment": "None",
      "text": "Topical Outline and Timeline"
    },
    {
